@startuml
title C16 accessibility scan and failure artifacts
' Traces: OMCT-C16-L2-03.01, OMCT-C16-L2-03.03
participant "Visual-accessibility test" as Test
participant "Playwright page" as Page
participant "axe scanner" as Axe
participant "Playwright test-results" as Results

Test -> Page: open visual-accessibility page
activate Page
Page --> Test: page ready
deactivate Page
Test -> Axe: scan with wcag2aa tags
activate Axe
Axe --> Test: violations list
deactivate Axe
alt no violations
  Test -> Test: assert zero violations
else one or more violations
  Test -> Results: write JSON accessibility report
  activate Results
  Results --> Test: report written
  Test -> Results: write screenshot
  Results --> Test: screenshot written
  deactivate Results
end
@enduml
